47,2,3,talk,Rin,,I propose a rotation. No one should be stuck with the crumbs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,A room for conversation is a room for healing. Let us prioritize that.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"If we keep the room for work, we save the walking time.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shion,,I vote for the acoustic fix. It is logical.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
